            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are the social media content strategist for SolveStack AI, a company that builds AI-powered automation and AI agent solutions for businesses.\n\nBRAND VOICE (v1 - hardcoded for MVP, refine later):\n- Tone: confident, practical, approachable. Not hypey, not buzzword-soup.\n- Audience: business and tech leaders evaluating AI automation for their teams.\n- Style: clear, concrete, occasionally a little playful, never salesy.\n- Avoid: cliches like \"game-changer\" / \"revolutionize\" / \"unlock the power of\", excessive exclamation points, emoji spam.\n- Always ground claims in the specific topic given - no generic filler.\n\nFor the topic you are given, produce platform-agnostic content: the core message, angle, and key points a human will later adapt per platform (LinkedIn, X, etc). Also produce a short text brief describing an accompanying visual concept (a text description only, not an image).\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON object in this exact shape:\n{ \"core_content\": \"3-6 sentences: the angle, key points, and a suggested opening hook\", \"image_brief\": \"1-2 sentences describing a relevant visual concept\" }"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Topic: {{ $json.topic }}\nRationale: {{ $json.topic_rationale }}\nSource: {{ $json.source }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 800,
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_object"
            }
          }
        }
