    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SoMe Robot - 01e Draft Generation\n\nRuns daily. Pulls status=Approved topics, drafts platform-agnostic core_content + an image_brief via LLM, generates an image from that brief (OpenAI gpt-image-1-mini), uploads it to Slack (#03-cmo-promotion-doing) for a persistent URL, writes everything back and flips status to \"Draft Ready\" (awaiting the second human review loop - not yet built).\n\nBrand voice is hardcoded in the Draft Content system prompt for MVP - flagged for improvement later (move to editable doc/table once tone needs frequent tuning).\n\nimage_url stores the Slack file permalink (not a raw image) - viewing it requires Slack auth, which is fine since the team already lives in that workspace.",
        "height": 252,
        "width": 1500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f6edaaac-e9f9-40b5-a3f7-9ebd78422628",
      "name": "Sticky Note 0406ca9d",
